<Base
  title="Jirón Tumbes — Sebastián Ortiz de Zevallos"
  description="Restoration of an interior courtyard in an old adobe house in Barranco."
  currentPage="projects"
>
  <article class="project">
    <div class="project__year">2021 · Architecture</div>
    <h1 class="project__title">Jirón Tumbes</h1>
    <p class="project__subtitle">Personal work · with Carolina Rivera</p>

    <div class="project__body">
      <p>
        I was hired to propose a restoration of an interior courtyard in an old
        adobe house in Barranco, where different artists would have their
        studios. The space would hold a loft studio with a mezzanine.
      </p>

      <p>
        Therefore I decided to contain and revive the existing adobe walls with a
        wood frame structure, that supported a new roof while bracing the
        existing walls and giving this interesting spatiality.
      </p>

      <p style="color: var(--ink-faint); font-style: italic; margin-top: 3rem;">
        Images and documentation coming soon.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="meta">
      <div><a href="/projects">← All projects</a></div>
      <div>2021</div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
